{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53114","headline":"上阳春辞 · 杨衡","name":"上阳春辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣皇自在（《千载佳句》卷下作「有」）长生殿，不向蓬莱王母家。\n（见《日本古典文学大系》七三册藤原公任《和汉朗咏集》卷下《帝王》）（〖1〗川口久雄校注云：架藏私注本题作《上阳春辞》，《千载佳句·禁中》作《上春词》，柿村本作《上阳春词》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}